otations behind  and they were in Russian and included  Russian language settings third the  Russians released all this information  through false personas one called DC  leaks and the other one called gusoff  err 2.0 DC leaks pretended to be an  American and gusoff ur 2.0 pretended to  be a Romanian but both of these accounts  have been linked forensic ly directly  back to the same command and control  servers in Russia that were owned  operated and maintained by the GRU in  Robert Moeller's indictment you can even  see that immediately before a particular  gusoff ur 2.0 posting the GRU officers  back in Russia were googling the exact  same phrases that became part of gusoff  ur 2.0 s message in other words they  would search for a particular English  phrase via Google perhaps because their  English wasn't so good and then that  same phrase would appear in Gusev ur 2.0  tweets the Russians also really  information through WikiLeaks the pseudo  journalistic institution run by  Australian born hacker Julian Assange  all of this evidence and more led the  intelligence community to issue a report  in January 2017 saying that it was the  Russians who were behind the attacks the  Senate Select Committee on Intelligence  in July 2018 issued a bipartisan report  supporting the intelligence community's  review saying it was a sound  intelligence product and adding their  own conclusion that the interference  campaign was personally approved by  President Vladimir Putin special counsel  Moore's indictment was so detailed that  it named the individual Russian  intelligence officials who were behind  the attack  moreover following the indictment the  New York Times reported that the  intelligence community actually had a  human source close to Vladimir Putin who  reported that Putin personally ordered  the hacking of the DNC  with the intent of aiding Donald Trump's  presidential campaign but that was just  the first part of the Russian campaign  the second part was in effect 